# Agent configuration
#
# This agent runs as a delegation target from main.
# It does NOT have its own Telegram bot - reports are delivered
# back through the delegating agent or via scheduled task output.
#
# To run standalone (if you add a bot token later):
#   Add ANTHROPIC_SCOUT_BOT_TOKEN=... to .env
#   npm start -- --agent anthropic-scout
#
# For now, runs as scheduled task on the main agent.

name: Anthropic Scout
description: Monitors Anthropic GitHub repos daily and reports new repos, updates, and partnership signals relevant to Breakout With AI

model: claude-sonnet-4-6
